    {{!-- ── Performance outcomes (issue #13) ───────────────────────────────
          Tiered like a spell's and shaped nothing like one. Chapter 9's tiers
          are almost all "+N to <a named category>", and the CATEGORY is the
          load-bearing half — a bare +3 tells a bard nothing about what it
          applies to. Reusing the spell editor here would have offered boxes
          for damage multipliers and threshold modifiers the chapter never
          uses, and no box for the scope. --}}
    <section class="la-panel la-panel--outcomes">
      <h2 class="la-panel__title">{{localize "LASTARC.Section.Outcomes"}}</h2>
      <p class="la-note">{{localize "LASTARC.Note.PerformOutcomes"}}</p>

      {{#each outcomes}}
